    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus. The narrative trajectory remains anchored in the operational milestones of late August 2026, where the team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_1) to materialize this strategy. This release was explicitly linked to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_3), which is characterized as the technical unlock for the current workflow. Concurrent performance data highlights a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_2), providing a quantitative signal of the development rhythm following these deployments.""" ;
